    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following Cunning Strike options.</p><p><strong>Bullseye (Cost: 2d6).</strong> Immediately after the attack, you can make a ranged attack against the same target with Advantage.</p><p><strong>Twinned Shot (Cost: 2d6).</strong> Immediately after the attack, you can make a ranged attack against a different target.</p><p><strong>Mark (Cost: 4d6).</strong> Until the start of your next turn, all attacks from your allies have Advantage on attack rolls against the target.</p>"
